# scripts/opcount: `askbench bench fenced N` reads a model's reply (a
# sentence and a markdown fence around a record's JSON) N times with
# llm.Parse (wf10 L6). The control is hand Go: the fence cut off by
# strings.Index and the body read by encoding/json.
unit reply
sizes 20000 120000
args bench fenced {n}
control benchmarks/llmask/testdata/control
